MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace direct binary manipulation with LLVM MC infrastructure for all
four B0→A0 patches (cluster_load, DS 2-addr, s_clause, tensor_load_to_lds).

Key fixes for LLVM MC pipeline reuse:
- Add MCObjectFileInfo to LLVMState to prevent null deref in
  MCELFStreamer::initSections()
- Call Ctx->reset() before each assembly to clear accumulated
  sections/symbols from prior passes
- Prepend .text directive to assembly strings (LLVM MC requirement)

New helpers: AssembleSingleInst() for single-instruction assembly,
RewriteDs2Addr() for DS 2-addr operand transformation, and reusable
NopSled infrastructure (BuildNopSledMap/FindNearestSled).

